{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-final-summary.md","title":"Local Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","display":"df-final-summary — Local Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-final-summary","aliases":["92-df-final-summary"],"display":"df-final-summary — Local Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","depends_on":["[[92-df-final-count]]"],"source":"本地九类导航分类；原书实际有十一章","source_status":"本地元数据"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-final-summary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-final-summary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-final-summary — Local Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地九类导航分类；原书实际有十一章"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地元数据"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\)</span> (atom-document set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_1,\\ldots,C_9\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92})^9\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_1,\\ldots,C_9\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92})^9\\)</span> (category family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\">\\(\\kappa:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\)</span> (category-assignment map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}\\)</span> (definition-target taxonomy predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}final\\text{-}summary} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}^{\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}}\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\;\\bigl(C_i=\\{a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\mid\\kappa(a)=i\\}\\land C_i\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}final\\text{-}summary} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}^{\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}}\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\;\\bigl(C_i=\\{a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\mid\\kappa(a)=i\\}\\land C_i\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本地目录分类谓词，不是原书的章节结构或全书完成证书。原书 PE/PA 的语法、公理与 proof code 已补为独立支线；有限集 K、beta 与指数消去已补上；模态分类已有第 XI 章的实际 K/K4/G 原子。κ 仍是输入参数，没有在此断言一个自动唯一分类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Local-Categories\">[Local Categories]</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-Basic-Formal-Systems\">1. Basic Formal Systems</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Formal system, formula, term, sentence, proof, axiom</li>\n<li>Logical system, connectives, quantifiers</li>\n<li>Language of arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_A\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_A\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2.-Gödel-Encoding\">2. Gödel Encoding</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel numbering, arithmetization</li>\n<li>Proof predicate, provability predicate</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c7c8d1473c7d455\" href=\"?note=0c7c8d1473c7d455\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma\">92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75a1feabdeb282fb\" href=\"?note=75a1feabdeb282fb\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1\">92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</a></li>\n<li>Substitution function, diagonal function, proof-code operations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3.-Recursion-Theory\">3. Recursion Theory</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>PR functions, recursive functions</li>\n<li>Composition, recursion, minimization</li>\n<li>CE sets, decidable sets, halting set</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4.-Self-Reference\">4. Self-Reference</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel sentence, Rosser sentence</li>\n<li>Löb sentence, Henkin sentence</li>\n<li>Syntactic fixed-point (diagonal) lemma</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5.-Incompleteness-Theorems\">5. Incompleteness Theorems</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>First incompleteness, second incompleteness</li>\n<li>Rosser improvement, Löb theorem</li>\n<li>Consistency strength hierarchy</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6.-Arithmetic-Hierarchy\">6. Arithmetic Hierarchy</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span> formulas</li>\n<li>Post theorem, hierarchy properties</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> completeness, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> incompleteness</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7.-Provability-Logic\">7. Provability Logic</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>GL system, axioms K/4/L</li>\n<li>Arithmetic realization</li>\n<li>Solovay completeness（原书 p.134 引述，完整逆向证明仍为外部引用）</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e69e849d9714457a\" href=\"?note=e69e849d9714457a\" title=\"92-df-modal-k-k4-g\">92-df-modal-k-k4-g</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2cf611da381080e0\" href=\"?note=2cf611da381080e0\" title=\"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization\">92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"71962c0a446ff8b2\" href=\"?note=71962c0a446ff8b2\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness\">92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8.-Model-Theory\">8. Model Theory</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>, nonstandard models</li>\n<li>True arithmetic TA</li>\n<li>Compactness, completeness theorem</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9.-Local-Supplementary-Topics\">9. Local Supplementary Topics</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Creative sets, productive sets, simple sets</li>\n<li>Many-one reducibility, m-complete sets</li>\n<li>Proof-theoretic ordinals, Gentzen consistency proof</li>\n<li>Normal ordinal functions and their ordinal fixed points</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Book-Information\">[Book Information]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6\" href=\"?note=cd8dcab3ce41cbc6\" title=\"92-book-info\">92-book-info</a> — Complete book info</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"baf256d78d60c2a6\" href=\"?note=baf256d78d60c2a6\" title=\"92-MOC\">92-MOC</a> — Master overview concept map</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>九类划分是对目录扩展材料的本地分类约定，不是原书章节。κ 与 C_i 是输入参数，本节点只定义分类谓词，未构造唯一分类。实际章节见书籍信息与主 MOC。</p>\n<p>原书定位：本地九类导航分类；原书实际有十一章。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Local-Categories","text":"[Local Categories]","level":2},{"id":"1.-Basic-Formal-Systems","text":"1. Basic Formal Systems","level":3},{"id":"2.-Gödel-Encoding","text":"2. Gödel Encoding","level":3},{"id":"3.-Recursion-Theory","text":"3. Recursion Theory","level":3},{"id":"4.-Self-Reference","text":"4. Self-Reference","level":3},{"id":"5.-Incompleteness-Theorems","text":"5. Incompleteness Theorems","level":3},{"id":"6.-Arithmetic-Hierarchy","text":"6. Arithmetic Hierarchy","level":3},{"id":"7.-Provability-Logic","text":"7. Provability Logic","level":3},{"id":"8.-Model-Theory","text":"8. Model Theory","level":3},{"id":"9.-Local-Supplementary-Topics","text":"9. Local Supplementary Topics","level":3},{"id":"Book-Information","text":"[Book Information]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-final-count","status":"resolved","id":"d115b577d99026dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-final-count]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-final-count","status":"resolved","id":"d115b577d99026dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}$ (atom-document set, see [[92-df-final-count]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. Gödel Encoding","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"0c7c8d1473c7d455","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. Gödel Encoding","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. Gödel Encoding","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","status":"resolved","id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"7. Provability Logic","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]、[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realizatio